Veska: [portrait=serious] Why do you do that?
Townsfolk2: Huh?
Veska: [portrait=frown]The wrapping, on't you know it's wrong to throw it on the ground?
set {npc_name2} = "Wanted criminal"
Townsfolk2: Ah!
Townsfolk2: Uhmm…
Townsfolk2: Well, have you seen a trash can around here??
